{title: Dil Tod Ke}
{artist: B Praak}
{key: A#m}

{c: Verse 1}
Tum [A#m] de rahi ho dil mein,        kisi [F#] aur ko jagah
[G#] Lekin koyi na chahega,        tu [F#] mko meri ta [A#m] rah
Kya [A#m] hai kusoor mera,        Jo [D#m] dil se utar gaya
[Fm] Mud ke bhi na dekha mujhe,        [F#] Tumne ek da [A#m] faa
[D#m] Jaise gayi ho.... [G#] ... [A#m],        [D#m] Jaise gayi ho
[C#] Jaata hai kya koyi,        [G#] Aise chhod ke
Dil [A#m] tod ke,        Ho dil [F#] tod ke hasti ho [G#] mera
Wa [Fm] fayein meri [F#] yaad karo [A#m] gi,        Pher [A#m] do mujhse aaj ni [G#] gaahein
[Fm] Kadar mere [F#] baad karo [A#m] gi,        Dil [A#m] tod ke
Ho [F#] dil tod ke,        Woh [A#m] tum hi to thi
Jo [G#] baar baar aake,        Lag [F#] ti thi gale me [A#m] re
Woh [A#m] bhi tum hi thi,        Har [D#m] roz sath jiske
Din [F#] raat dhale me [A#m] re,        [D#m] Kahan gayi tum ho... [G#] ... [A#m]
[D#m] Kahan gayi tum [F#] dard se mera,        [G#] Rishta jod ke.....
Dil [A#m] tod ke,        Ho dil [F#] tod ke hasti ho [G#] mera
Wa [Fm] fayein meri [F#] yaad karo [A#m] gi,        Pher [A#m] do mujhse aaj ni [G#] gaahein
[Fm] Kadar mere [F#] baad karo [A#m] gi,        Dil [A#m] tod ke
Ho [F#] dil tod ke,        Ho [A#m] galiyo galiyo [G#] liye fira mai
[F#] Tukda tukda [A#m] dil,        [A#m] Kaash kisi ne [G#] poochha hota
[F#] Kaise ujda [A#m] dil,        Ho [D#m] galiyon galiyo [F#] liye fira mai
[G#] Tukda tukda [A#m] dil,        [D#m] Kaash kisi ne [F#] poochha hota
[G#] Kaise ujda [A#m] dil,        [D#m] Kaise bhar di..... [G#] ..... [A#m]
[D#m] Kaise bhar di [C#] nadiya maine,        [A] Aanchal nichod ke......
Dil [A#m] tod ke,        Ho dil [F#] tod ke hasti ho [G#] mera
Wa [Fm] fayein meri [F#] yaad karo [A#m] gi,        Pher [A#m] do mujhse aaj ni [G#] gaahein
[Fm] Kadar mere [F#] baad karo [A#m] gi,        Dil [A#m] tod ke
Ho [F#] dil tod ke,        Sirf dil toota hai saans nahi
Dhadkanon mein rawani abhi baaki hai,        Pyar ka kissa khatam ho gaya to kya
Zindagi ki kahaani abhi baaki hai,        Haaye dil [A#m] tod ke
